{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3656","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3656","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3656\",\"parent_revision\":\"2fc43630d96036803737901f472d795be644e9bc\",\"root_revision\":\"400dd4d9327d632e9530fe1a7dcbb2ee25df7fee1c4ed8168e029ab26f4e4939\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: needs-grooming\\nadded: 2026-09-19\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nRight after a `backlog_groom` append reports `groomed_updated: true`, `backlog_view(map=True)` and `backlog_view(section=..., include_content=false)` can report the pre-write entry count for that section, even with `refresh=true` and after `sync_now()`. `backlog_view(navigate=\\\"<section>.<next index>\\\")` returns the new entry at the same moment.\\n\\nObserved on #3060 on 2026-09-19 by the impact-analyst (Impact Radius append), and in the orchestrator's own reads the same day.\\n\\nImpact: an agent that verifies its write with the map concludes the write failed and retries, which appends a duplicate entry. The impact-analyst recorded a memory note telling itself to verify with navigate= instead \u2014 a workaround in one agent's memory, not a fix.\\n\\nExpected: map and section metadata reflect the same state that navigate= returns.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session observation, re-groom of #3060, 2026-09-19\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-09-19\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"ffc2c07b6b9079a82df1728b12844bfe3a45b6d723017ec2609a6d7fdecf2599\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABYnKSKA\",\"fields\":{\"followup_to\":\"\",\"close_reference\":\"\",\"added\":\"2026-09-19\",\"layer\":\"\",\"research_first\":\"\",\"source\":\"Not specified\",\"priority\":\"P1\",\"language\":\"\",\"suggested_location\":\"\",\"status\":\"needs-grooming\",\"close_reason\":\"\",\"stack\":\"\",\"item_type\":\"Bug\",\"close_comment\":\"\",\"files\":\"\",\"topic\":\"\",\"groomed\":\"\",\"plan\":\"\"}}"}